    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0174" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg68"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pacheco to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States in Guatemala and
                                Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Pacheco informs the Department that the steamer <hi rendition="#italic">City
                        of Panama</hi>, being refused clearance papers at La Union on account of
                    refusing to give up political refugees on board, left that place without
                    clearance papers, and, upon reaching Libertad, was detained and declared
                    confiscated.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
